  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate the osmotic pressure in pascals exerted by a solution prepared by dissolving 1.0 g of polymer of molar mass 185000 in 450 mL of water at 37<sup>o</sup> C.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "30.95",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Mass of polymer (W<sub>B</sub>) = 1.0 g<br /><br />Molar mass of polymer (M<sub>B</sub>) = 185000 g mol<sup>-1</sup><br /><br />Volume of solution (V) = 450 mL = 0.450 L<br /><br />Temperature (T) = 37 + 273 = 310 K<br /><br />Solution constant (R) = 8.314 x 10<sup>3</sup> Pa L K<sup>-1</sup> mol<sup>-1</sup><br /><br />Osmotic pressure <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>π</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>CRT</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>W</mtext> <mtext>B</mtext> </msub> <mo>×</mo> <mtext>R</mtext> <mo>×</mo> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>M</mtext> <mtext>B</mtext> </msub> <mo>×</mo> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mi>π</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>1.0</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>×</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>8.314</mtext> <mo>×</mo> <msup> <mtext>10</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mtext>Pa</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <msup> <mtext>L K</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> <msup> <mtext>mol</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>×</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>310 K</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>185000 g mol</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>×</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>0.450 L</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br />= 30.95 Pa",
